<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦπου</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ
			που</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>I ween</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ που σοφὸς ἦν ὅστις ἔφασκεν . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					725
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ που νέος γ᾽ ὢν ἦσθ᾽ ὑβριστής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					63
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.830
			</span></i>; ironical, 
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1008
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1308
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλεπὸν πόλιν κατασκευάσασθαι, ἦ
				που δή . . </span>
			<i>much more . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.142
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ που</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				30.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				84d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ πού γε</span> lsoc.<i><span class="en">
				1.49
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ που δή . . </span>
			<i>much less</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.27
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ πού γε δή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.37
				</span></i>
			: and with a neg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ που . . γε . . οὐ δεῖ χρήσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.86
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> to make a
			hesitating suggestion, <i>surely . . ?</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.234
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				521
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				970
			</span></i>.</div>
